<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#A0A1A7;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#7F848E;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic;"># 只导出容器当下 rootfs；历史、层和大部分配置会丢失</span></span>
